# knit's Osc 2 page (testers: more from osc 2): EDIT's second page on a knit track, after Engine. interval (TP_X1),
# fine (+-50 cents), wave (same: osc 1's, by default; saw, square, pulse, triangle, sine), shape (osc 2's own saw ..
# square .. pulse, set where the wave sits when the wave turns to one of those; "-" for the others). Another engine
# has no such page; the values stay over a restart and in a user preset, a factory preset sets them back
wait 300
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
knob 3 engine knit
tap EDIT
turn SELECT 1
expect page Osc_2
expect par3.o2wave 0
expect par3.o2shape 0
listen
wait 400
said Osc 2
shot osc2_same.png
# the wave: saw, square, pulse each set the shape where they sit
spin K3 1
wait 400
said wave saw
expect par3.o2wave 1
expect par3.o2shape 0
spin K3 1
expect par3.o2wave 2
expect par3.o2shape 64
spin K3 1
expect par3.o2wave 3
expect par3.o2shape 127
spin K4 -27
expect par3.o2shape 100
# with osc 2 heard (its level on Levels) at a fifth: the picture
knob 3 x1 71
knob 3 x2 90
wait 40
shot osc2_pulse.png
spin K3 1
expect par3.o2wave 4
wait 400
said wave triangle
spin K3 1
expect par3.o2wave 5
spin K3 1
expect par3.o2wave 5
spin K3 -3
expect par3.o2wave 2
expect par3.o2shape 64
# fine: here, in cents
spin K2 12
expect par3.fine 76
wait 400
said fine +12 ct
wait 40
shot osc2_square.png
# Osc 2 is EDIT's second page: SELECT back to Engine, on to Levels
turn SELECT -1
expect page Engine
turn SELECT 2
expect page Levels
turn SELECT -1
expect page Osc_2
# HOME held turns osc 2's interval, as without it (the old shortcut to fine is gone)
press HOME
wait 600
spin K1 2
release HOME
wait 40
expect par3.x1 73
expect par3.fine 76
expect page Osc_2
# kept over a restart
projsave 1
reboot
wait 400
expect par3.o2wave 2
expect par3.o2shape 64
expect par3.fine 76
# a user preset keeps them, a factory preset sets them back to osc 1's wave
usersave 3 3
preset 3 reese
expect par3.o2wave 0
expect par3.o2shape 0
expect par3.fine 64
preset 3 U3
expect par3.o2wave 2
expect par3.o2shape 64
expect par3.fine 76
reboot
wait 400
preset 3 U3
expect par3.o2wave 2
# another engine: no Osc 2 page (on it: back to the first page)
tap EDIT
turn SELECT 1
expect page Osc_2
knob 3 engine rayon
wait 40
expect page Engine
expect par3.o2wave 0
turn SELECT 1
expect page Sub
turn SELECT 3
expect page Engine
